      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/a88e4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-14T19:28:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ambuscade and Kismet seem to go fairly quickly, in my experience. Plague Rat, too.</p><p>Most of the damage-race type villains should work fairly well under a strict time limit. I definitely wouldn't recommend Citizen Dawn or the Chairman in a lunch hour, though.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Miss Information is right out.&nbsp;</p>",
