      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-14T20:08:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>While I don't think that game would have ended in victory we might have survived a little longer. &nbsp; Normal Infinitor games can go on a lot longer. &nbsp; Deadline is a villain that has a built in timer especially if you can't consistently destroy his Ongoings. &nbsp;Hero selection can make a difference too. &nbsp; If you all play heroes who typically have a longer setup like Bunker, Unity, or AZ it can make the game longer and similar can occur if you don't have any heroes who deal consistent damage. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
